{"data":[{"author_id":"793853199975272448","created_at":"2026-10-10T14:46:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108932130235699495"],"id":"2108932130235699495","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1890,"like_count":28,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":2},"text":"2026年9月台湾出生人口只有7704人，死亡人口16712人。其中出生人口相比去年同期减少10.4％，相比前年同期减少34.7％，已经连续18个月不足1万人\n2026年前三季度台湾出生人口69446人，死亡人口148810人，出生人口相比去年同期减少14.7％，相比前年同期减少28.9％\n\n台湾今年生育率大概0.6全世界倒数第一了","url":"https://x.com/Jasuki__Hope/status/2108932130235699495"},{"author_id":"2097838603678392320","created_at":"2026-10-10T00:59:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108724179550040302"],"id":"2108724179550040302","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"预判国内2026年出生人口：不超过700万，接近700万。\n\n00后婚育意愿持续下滑；80、90后有生育能力者基本已完成生育，存量空间很小。再叠加AI冲击就业、人们对未来前景的担忧，以及00后更重视个人生活品质，多重因素叠加，我判定2026年出生人口不会超过700万。以此帖为证。","url":"https://x.com/rjunzc/status/2108724179550040302"},{"author_id":"2030952802881880064","created_at":"2026-10-11T08:59:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109207175570890952"],"id":"2109207175570890952","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"1985年出生人口2100万，2023年出生人口900万。知道这2个数字意味着什么？到2045年的时候，数字1退休了，数字2该缴社保了。 数字2需要2个人缴纳的钱才够养1个数字1。但数字2却比数字1少了一半以上。也就说2023年以后出生的都是傻子，因为傻子必须上缴更多的钱。","url":"https://x.com/slgy9999/status/2109207175570890952"},{"author_id":"1755611628618571776","created_at":"2026-10-11T13:09:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109270204727304426"],"id":"2109270204727304426","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":429,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"出生人口性低真的是因为避孕套的出现吗？🤣🤣🤣 https://t.co/8ty1cMs9O4","url":"https://x.com/joeetuog/status/2109270204727304426"},{"author_id":"1886317320181886976","created_at":"2026-10-11T13:57:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109282123949703330"],"id":"2109282123949703330","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今年出生人口才 700 多万，以后真的可以领得到吗？这真的不是庞氏吗 https://t.co/xQPZaThVgB","url":"https://x.com/Kong1099917/status/2109282123949703330"},{"author_id":"2097838603678392320","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:01:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108724595021033609"],"id":"2108724595021033609","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"如果把预期放得更为激进，我判断2026年国内出生人口甚至难以突破600万。","url":"https://x.com/rjunzc/status/2108724595021033609"},{"author_id":"2038647826024992770","created_at":"2026-10-11T08:25:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109198685624238158"],"id":"2109198685624238158","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":126,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"现在孩子都是累赘\n\n估计以后出生人口会继续降低\n\n我们这代就越不可能领到社保，就越不会交\n\n死循环 https://t.co/pY6G6DkjkT","url":"https://x.com/2S09Uyi15m17957/status/2109198685624238158"},{"author_id":"1163059050","created_at":"2026-10-10T03:29:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108761733301252525"],"id":"2108761733301252525","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1543,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"一年仅出生743人，生育最低的地方出现了。\n\n全国出生率最低的地方是黑龙江，黑龙江出生率最低的地方是哪里？\n\n统计公报显示，2025年大兴安岭地区户籍人口35.76万人，出生人口743人，出生率2.04‰；死亡人口7524人，死亡率20.70‰；人口自然增长率-18.66‰。 https://t.co/VaZekC494x","url":"https://x.com/hlxf99/status/2108761733301252525"},{"author_id":"1386781061519187970","created_at":"2026-10-11T16:29:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109320453873614992"],"id":"2109320453873614992","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":40,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"未来十大预言\n1、房地产风口基本结束，除了北上广深等极个别地段还会有小范围开发之外，大量的二三四线城市以及县城中心区域的房地产熄火，房价不会骤降，也不会抬升，基本稳定在当前的位置，三四线和县城可能还会钝刀子割肉一样的下降一些。","url":"https://x.com/Fanniangao/status/2109320453873614992"},{"author_id":"1668871702602809345","created_at":"2026-10-11T12:47:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109264529700090223"],"id":"2109264529700090223","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"1973年\n\n北京出生人口13.7万\n\n1990年\n北京高中招了10.79万\n\n我家所在县，小地方。有八十万农民。\n73年大概出生1.2万人。\n90年。高中招收800人","url":"https://x.com/ngl650453379606/status/2109264529700090223"},{"author_id":"2085226926835367937","created_at":"2026-10-10T06:58:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108814310663180318"],"id":"2108814310663180318","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":420,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"国人都被生活，逼成什么样了啊\n一个百万级户籍人口的地级市，全年出生人口不到2000人！\n\n人生的意义到底是什么？ https://t.co/61QpU5Dox5","url":"https://x.com/wangyunWY0203/status/2108814310663180318"},{"author_id":"2095680128168914944","created_at":"2026-10-11T01:31:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109094585620365712"],"id":"2109094585620365712","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":100,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有一个数据放在一起看，很荒诞。\n\n2025年出生人口792万，生育率跌到0.98，创1949年以来最低。\n\n同年，城镇职工养老保险抚养比降到2.59比1，大约2.6个在职职工养1个退休职工。\n\n这两个数字其实在讲同一件事。\n\n现收现付的养老制度下，你的养老金不是自己存的钱，是下一代人交的钱。","url":"https://x.com/xuzhang173/status/2109094585620365712"},{"author_id":"1740353535055929344","created_at":"2026-10-11T06:45:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109173364590018565","2109173437939982408"],"id":"2109173437939982408","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":31,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国的社会抚养比目前是多少？现在出生人口断崖下跌，预测2040年开始社会抚养比是多少？要保障社保不崩，需要不断提高社保缴费比例？@grok","url":"https://x.com/lidayou369/status/2109173437939982408"},{"author_id":"1740353535055929344","created_at":"2026-10-11T06:44:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109173364590018565","2109173437939982408"],"id":"2109173364590018565","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国的社会抚养比目前是多少？现在出生人口断崖下跌，预测2040年开始社会抚养比是多少？要保障社保不崩，需要不断提高社保缴费比例？","url":"https://x.com/lidayou369/status/2109173364590018565"},{"author_id":"1622139884038426625","created_at":"2026-10-11T09:51:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109220231449325905"],"id":"2109220231449325905","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"李迅雷：不认同中国房地产已进入筑底阶段\n\n人口老龄化加速、出生人口减少、2020年以后城镇化进程放缓，都对房地产长期走势不利。 https://t.co/dUi5SS2JtX","url":"https://x.com/Agui2023/status/2109220231449325905"},{"author_id":"1953080616528035841","created_at":"2026-10-11T07:30:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109184779287740698"],"id":"2109184779287740698","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这个社保你们会交吗？\n反正我不交，出生人口越来越少了，\n等到我领的时候大概率领不到，\n有这钱我不说投资qqq，我投资a股的工商银行稳定性都秒杀这个。 https://t.co/0xUaZtYGd6","url":"https://x.com/LuckyJinkesi/status/2109184779287740698"},{"author_id":"1205132347164639237","created_at":"2026-10-11T08:04:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109193460075073668"],"id":"2109193460075073668","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":144,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"新闻要连起来看，出生人口从2017年的阶段高点1786万，逐步断崖下跌到2025年的792万。然后社保部门、税务部门、住建部门分别开始发力了，核心其实就是财政没钱了。 https://t.co/uS6RiKN8Ng","url":"https://x.com/yunxiaopku/status/2109193460075073668"},{"author_id":"1327279681041698816","created_at":"2026-10-11T00:34:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109080134812872898"],"id":"2109080134812872898","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":80,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2026年出生人口已经确定在720万-750万之间，总人口可能跌破14亿\n因为全年建档人数已经确定了，唯一不知道的就是die了多少，如果超过1100万去世总人口就不足14亿了","url":"https://x.com/Zeno12x/status/2109080134812872898"},{"author_id":"1830493173099208704","created_at":"2026-10-10T08:54:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108843622959612125"],"id":"2108843622959612125","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":203,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2020到2029年中共国出生人口预估只有6000多万\n这个视频好像是19年预测的还是高估了\n\n给我感觉2035年人口可能只还剩12亿\n2950年10亿了\n\n说真的，中共国政府人口政策一蹋糊涂 https://t.co/lS4GI6mgCi","url":"https://x.com/Ellenalice7990/status/2108843622959612125"},{"author_id":"1243971485829455872","created_at":"2026-10-11T07:07:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109178980393992377"],"id":"2109178980393992377","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"千万不要相信网上“太岁说法”\n全球每年有多少出生人口？逢要“化太岁”的这些人全球多少亿人?这几亿的人没有化太岁就都倒霉？\n虽然我是算命的，但是我鄙视这些神棍。化太岁妥妥智商税。","url":"https://x.com/7LDeDp87fcdROSI/status/2109178980393992377"},{"author_id":"1824675511865323520","created_at":"2026-10-10T16:08:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108952916736528560"],"id":"2108952916736528560","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":229,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108467529559445527","type":"quoted"}],"text":"性少数在人群中的占比仅为5%∽10%左右，这其中还有很多的双性恋之类的。这么掐指一算，真正走向完全的同性伴侣的人并不多。可以认为他们对出生人口的因素很少，这件事本来就怪不到他们。 https://t.co/SbvYqOgd7b","url":"https://x.com/whatismeff14354/status/2108952916736528560"},{"author_id":"2080515158817026048","created_at":"2026-10-10T07:52:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108828039169675749"],"id":"2108828039169675749","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":56,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"一组让人发凉的数据\n\n2024年，结婚登记同比降20.5%\n2025年，出生人口同比降约17%\n\n这俩数字像一对前后脚出门的人\n\n前面的少了，后面的只会更少\n\n很多人聊生育，只盯着\"生\"，其实最早亮红灯的，是\"结\"","url":"https://x.com/dengfenglai2002/status/2108828039169675749"},{"author_id":"1974268603361861632","created_at":"2026-10-10T17:44:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108976994830491925"],"id":"2108976994830491925","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":56,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"全国出生人数见顶于2016年，之后一路快速下滑。去年的出生人口跌破800万，只有792万人，相比于2016年腰斩不止。八九年的时间，出生人数断崖式下滑， 所有与人口相关的产业都会走下坡路， 除了老龄化。 https://t.co/Vje8kFOZ2P","url":"https://x.com/JuanUS0914/status/2108976994830491925"},{"author_id":"1327279681041698816","created_at":"2026-10-11T02:01:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109101944644194516"],"id":"2109101944644194516","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":166,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国最大的退休潮来了 👴👵\n按出生人口推算，2022 到 2036 年，会有 3.82 亿人陆续年满 60 岁。\n平均每天将近 7 万人。\n\n一边是每年只出生七百多万，一边是每天 7 万人退休。\n养老金谁来交？延迟退休还会再延吗？\n\n你觉得自己能按时退休吗？👇\n\n#退休潮 #养老金 #人口 https://t.co/rxn0Pffp1Z","url":"https://x.com/Zeno12x/status/2109101944644194516"},{"author_id":"1818245923400826880","created_at":"2026-10-10T14:30:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108928149341806884"],"id":"2108928149341806884","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":137,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国未来25年平均每天6.3万人退休，合每年2300万。而2025年出生人口是792万。也许有一天推翻中共的主力，可能会变成绝望的退休人员。这也是为什么今天微博热搜有两条：“鼓励灵活就业人员参加职工养老保险”和“人社部通过数据找人动员参保”。 https://t.co/akLB0Mbdr8","url":"https://x.com/lm36822/status/2108928149341806884"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"793853199975272448","name":"Jasuki__Hope","username":"Jasuki__Hope"},{"id":"2097838603678392320","name":"风行","username":"rjunzc"},{"id":"2030952802881880064","name":"纸袋哥","username":"slgy9999"},{"id":"1755611628618571776","name":"jueetuon⭐","username":"joeetuog"},{"id":"1886317320181886976","name":"醒目","username":"Kong1099917"},{"id":"2038647826024992770","name":"逆尘(互关)","username":"2S09Uyi15m17957"},{"id":"1163059050","name":"赫鲁小夫","username":"hlxf99"},{"id":"13867810